#. module: crm_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:crm_compassion.event_letter_template
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"invoice_lines\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"donations\" t-value=\"invoice_lines.get_donations()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"ambassadors\" t-value=\"invoice_lines.mapped(&#x27;user_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"count\" t-value=\"0\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"currency\" t-value=\"invoice_lines[0].move_id.currency_id.name\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    On behalf of Compassion Switzerland we truly thank you for your <t t-out=\"&#x27;generous&#x27; if object.config_id.id != 52 else &#x27;&#x27;\"></t> gift of <br/><t t-out=\"donations[0]\"></t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"donations[1]\">\n"
"                        <!-- space --> supporting\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"ambassadors\">\n"
"                            <!-- space --> <t t-out=\"ambassadors.get_list(&#x27;full_name&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                            <!-- space --> for the <t t-out=\"donations[1]\"></t>.\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-foreach=\"ambassadors.filtered(&#x27;advocate_details_id.quote&#x27;)\" t-as=\"amb\">\n"
"                       <t t-set=\"count\" t-value=\"count + 1\"/>\n"
"<div id=\"ambassador_quote\">\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"amb.advocate_details_id.thank_you_quote\"></t>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"                         <t t-if=\"len(ambassadors) != 1 and len(ambassadors) != count\">\n"
"                                  <br/>\n"
"                                  <br/>\n"
"                                  <br/>\n"
"                           </t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"len(ambassadors) == 2\">\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"</t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.event_id.thank_you_text\">\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.event_id.thank_you_text\"></t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"partner.number_sponsorships\">\n"
"                        Have you recently written to your sponsor child? Our website allows you to write a letter directly online. Why not have another go at writing this week?\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"partner.is_new_donor\">\n"
"                            Since 1952, Compassion has been pursuing a very specific mission: to release as many children as possible from extreme poverty – in Jesus’ name.\n"
"In collaboration with 8600 local churches, we currently support 2,3 million children in 27 countries of the global south.\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"not partner.opt_out\">\n"
"                            Is the future of the world's poorest children important to you? Compassion offers different ways and solutions to release children from poverty. At the heart of Compassion’s ministry is the Child Sponsorship program. Maybe you would consider sponsoring a child and offering support and encouragement throughout their development? You can find further information on\n"
"www.compassion.ch or you can call us on 0800 874 773.\n"
"                                 <br/>\n"
"                                 <br/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    We just want to take this opportunity to thank you once again for your generosity and support towards these children in need.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Sincerely yours\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"    Rachel Maglo\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Donors relation\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Compassion Switzerland\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"len(ambassadors) != 0 and len(ambassadors) != 1\">\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"</t>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"invoice_lines\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"donations\" t-value=\"invoice_lines.get_donations()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids.filtered(&#x27;is_active&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ambassadors\" t-value=\"invoice_lines.mapped(&#x27;user_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"count\" t-value=\"0\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"currency\" t-value=\"invoice_lines[0].move_id.currency_id.name\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie di cuore per la <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostra&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tua&#x27;\"></t> donazione di <t t-out=\"donations[0]\"></t> a favore del progetto di Ambassador <t t-out=\"ambassadors.get_list(&#x27;full_name&#x27;)\"></t> per <t t-out=\"donations[1]\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-foreach=\"ambassadors.filtered(&#x27;advocate_details_id.quote&#x27;)\" t-as=\"amb\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"count\" t-value=\"count + 1\"/>\n"
"        </p><div id=\"ambassador_quote\">\n"
"            <t t-out=\"amb.advocate_details_id.thank_you_quote\"></t>\n"
"            <br/>\n"
"        </div>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Il <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> impegno, insieme a quello di oltre <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> chiese partner in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> Paesi del Sud, ci permette attualmente di sostenere <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> milioni di bambini. Con un obiettivo comune: liberare in modo duraturo dalla povertà il maggior numero possibile di bambini.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"not sponsorships\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Desider<t t-out=\"&#x27;ate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;i&#x27;\"></t> sostenere un bambino? Qui <t t-out=\"&#x27;potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;puoi&#x27;\"></t> trovare i bambini per i quali Compassion cerca urgentemente un sostenitore: <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/sostegno-individuale/sostieni-un-bambino/\">compassion.ch/it/sostegno-individuale/sostieni-un-bambino/</a>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Per qualsiasi domanda relativa alla <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostra&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tua&#x27;\"></t> donazione, non esita<t t-out=\"&#x27;t&#x27; if plural else &#x27;r&#x27;\"></t>e a contattarci. Grazie ancora per il <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> contributo nel cambiare il mondo, un bambino alla volta.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti e a presto!\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

